/"INTERRUPT SERVICE CHAIN"
/	ALTHOUGH THE PROGRAM AS WRITTEN RUNS WITH THE
/INTERRUPTS OFF, IT IS WRITTEN SO SIMPLE MODIFICATIONS
/WOULD ALLOW IT TO RUN UNDER INTERRUPT CONTROL.  RTS-8
/PERFORMS THESE FUNCTIONS IN TIME-SHARE MODE.
/
START,	TAD (SKIPLOC-1
	DCA 10
NEXT=	JMP .
	CLA
	TAD I 10	/TRANSFER CONTROL TO NEXT LOCATION
	SNA		/IN THE LIST OF INTERRUPT SERVICE
	NEXT		/ROUTINES.
	DCA TEMPX
	JMP I TEMPX
/
